  /* registry.faa.gov refuses every self-identifying agent (engine UA 403, the
   * agent above 403, no User-Agent 200). It is now in BROWSER_HOSTS below. */

/* ── HA_COMPAT: the batch 44-48 bot walls (were 471 per-row headers) ─────
 * 2026-10-20: of 523 dropped rows that answered 403 to the engine, 491 store
 * their feed under this agent (11,159 emitted / 11,159 stored), and every row
 * on these hosts carried it. CLAUDE.md: "a 403 is usually a wall against the
